# Cloudspire Coordinator (3/1, "when this creature enters, scry 2"; "{T}: create X 1/1 Pilot tokens, where X is the number of Mounts and/or
# Vehicles that entered the battlefield under your control this turn"): on turn one Bot1 casts it (Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl) and keeps the Plains
# on top of its library, bottoming the Island (CR 701.22a). On turn three it casts a Bulwark Ox (a Mount) and a Cloudspire Skycycle (a Vehicle),
# which puts its two counters on the Ox, then taps the Coordinator: X is 2, two Pilots, each 1/1 with the crewing and saddling ability.
# The Coordinator, a Human Pilot, is neither.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Cloudspire Coordinator
Black Lotus
Bulwark Ox
Cloudspire Skycycle
Mox Sapphire
Plains
Island
Island x12

